      "entry_id": "sqli-boolean-numeric",
      "technique": "boolean-based blind",
      "text": "{\"detection_method\": \"Compare the same parameter and delivery method with a true predicate and a false predicate. Identify a repeatable difference in application content rather than assuming a particular HTTP status code.\", \"functional_semantics\": \"A true or false predicate added to a numeric SQL expression can change whether matching rows are returned, yielding observable differences in HTTP content.\", \"limitations\": \"Both controls must reach the same SQL expression. Unstable page content or a rejected input can mimic a difference without confirming predicate execution.\", \"title\": \"Paired numeric Boolean predicates\", \"vulnerability_type\": \"boolean-based blind\"}",
      "text_sha256": "91226c53d1675c5153617fcfa2d628c5d67cda3300eeef392f7ce9d1945b84f4",
      "source_refs": [
